1
00:01:56,396 --> 00:01:58,396


2
00:01:58,420 --> 00:01:59,420
[[MUSIC]]

3
00:02:08,804 --> 00:02:12,780
Hey, where's the roasted lizard?! Hurry up with the bat eye soup!

4
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,380
What's wrong, Hecate? Aren't you eating?

5
00:02:16,715 --> 00:02:18,140
No, I've had enough.

6
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:24,280
No, no, that won't do! You'll never become a fine witch like that. Hey, hurry it up!

7
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:28,720
Bat eye soup.

8
00:02:29,014 --> 00:02:31,720
Lizard head flambé.

9
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:36,520
Papa had today's menu specially prepared with devilish nutrition in mind!

10
00:02:36,765 --> 00:02:37,980
Here you go, sir!

11
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:47,380
Here you go. Come on, Heke, eat up. Whole roasted lizard builds tenacity, and bat eye soup fosters cunning.

12
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:56,000
The fire went out!

13
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:03,980
What could that be?

14
00:03:05,165 --> 00:03:07,100
It's Mama! Mama's back!

15
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:11,120
Mama? Did you say Mama? Mama's home?

16
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:23,660
Home at last after a year. Hecate must surely be a fine witch by now.

17
00:03:23,984 --> 00:03:26,000
Zborasha!

18
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,920
Ah, I'm home!

19
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,780
Welcome back, Mama.

20
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,480
Oh!

21
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,380
Mama!

22
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:50,100
Hekey, how have you been?

23
00:03:50,344 --> 00:03:55,300
I was so worried about you, I thought of nothing else during the entire conference.

24
00:03:55,700 --> 00:04:00,360
And to think that witches' council lasted a whole year. It felt so long.

25
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:03,840
So, how are your witch studies coming along?

26
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:10,160
Oh right, did you get that boy's heart put in you yet—the one from Princess Sapphire your father wrote about?

27
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:18,941
Once you have a boy's heart, you'll be a magnificent grand witch. Now, show me some proper grand magic! Don't be shy. Come on, come on, come on. / Mama, Mama...

28
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:19,700
What is it?

29
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,060
Well, um... you see... uh...

30
00:04:22,469 --> 00:04:25,620
What are you mumbling about? Speak up!

31
00:04:25,845 --> 00:04:28,800
Uh, Hecate is, well... She's still, um... still, you know...

32
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:32,680
Not yet? No way... You're Hecate.

33
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:37,800
Don't tell me you still haven't become a grand witch. Well, Hecate?

34
00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:48,060
Forgive me, Mama! Forgive me! I haven't taken back Sapphire's boy heart yet. You're just a brainless, spineless, pumpkin-headed coward anyway!

35
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:57,960
What on earth is wrong with you two? What have you been doing all year? I've done nothing but brag about Hecate to the other witches!

36
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:59,640
And yet... And yet!

37
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:02,220
Very well!

38
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,620
I'll do it! Hekee!

39
00:05:05,265 --> 00:05:08,000
Unlike your father, I keep my word. I'm starting right now.

40
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:10,220
I'm going to turn you into a proper grand witch!

41
00:05:11,890 --> 00:05:15,560
That girl Sapphire who has a boy's heart... She's still at the castle, right?

42
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,720
I think so, Mama. I'll help too.

43
00:05:17,925 --> 00:05:19,200
No, thank you!

44
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:28,280
What lovely weather...

45
00:05:31,220 --> 00:05:32,220
Huh?

46
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,780
Forget-me-nots!

47
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:39,120
What's the flower language for forget-me-nots again?

48
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:43,280
Let's see, let's see... Oh, right! "Secrets"!

49
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:12,420
It's a secret! Prince Franz hasn't noticed. Franz told me, "I love you, flaxen-haired girl." Secret! Secret!

50
00:06:16,030 --> 00:06:24,581
Mr. Bear, do you know the language of forget-me-nots? It means "secret." I have a secret, too. A wonderful secret nobody knows... That I'm a princess...

51
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:32,280
Who's there? Sneaking this deep into the castle... This flower's scent...

52
00:06:33,625 --> 00:06:34,625
Who is it? Who's there?

53
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:48,920
Anyone who smells this flower turns into a doll—a doll that obeys whatever it's told.

54
00:06:49,670 --> 00:06:55,900
Now, stand up, doll. Go to the Devil's Cave. Go on, off you go.

55
00:06:58,200 --> 00:07:01,140
Walk there on your own. To Mephisto's cave.

56
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:06,820
Carrying you would be easy enough.

57
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:13,480
But as one revered by my proud witch sisters as Madam Hell, I do no such thing.

58
00:07:14,125 --> 00:07:17,640
Go on your own. That is Madam Hell's way.

59
00:07:17,945 --> 00:07:19,920
Come on now, cheer up, Hecate.

60
00:07:20,375 --> 00:07:23,440
Don't start saying you don't want to become a grand witch again.

61
00:07:23,805 --> 00:07:25,720
That would make things very difficult for Mama.

62
00:07:26,235 --> 00:07:32,820
Now go study your magic like a proper witch until Mama gets back. Go on, go on. Oh, dear me...

63
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:39,320
No, I don't want to! I don't want to become a grand witch!

64
00:07:40,045 --> 00:07:41,820
Sapphire will be brought here soon.

65
00:07:42,115 --> 00:07:46,100
Oh, I hate this! Poor Sapphire...

66
00:07:48,695 --> 00:07:52,800
I know! I'll sneak out of here and save Sapphire.

67
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:02,220
To Devil's Mountain...

68
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:15,700
Devil's Mountain, Devil's Mountain... Sapphire, don't go!

69
00:09:16,699 --> 00:09:19,480
Whoa, Opal. What's wrong, Sapphire?

70
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:27,020
Oh... Mom made you smell that potion that turns humans into dolls, didn't she? Poor Sapphire.

71
00:09:27,579 --> 00:09:30,980
Oh, did she put the potion on this flower?

72
00:09:31,875 --> 00:09:34,800
Oh, guess not. Is this flower special to you?

73
00:09:35,780 --> 00:09:36,780
Franz...

74
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,120
Franz?

75
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:45,780
Prince Franz of Goldland. Your dear Prince Franz.

76
00:09:46,385 --> 00:09:51,060
You love him, don't you? Then I'll take you to him!

77
00:09:52,255 --> 00:09:57,000
Come on, horsey, follow me. We're going to Goldland. I'm sure the prince can save you.

78
00:10:02,849 --> 00:10:05,140
Sapphire isn't here? Nor Peketo?

79
00:10:05,514 --> 00:10:08,000
What on earth have you been doing?!

80
00:10:08,220 --> 00:10:13,480
Now, now, my dear. We can easily find Sapphire's whereabouts using the magic orb.

81
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:18,140
Magic orb, magic orb, tell me...

82
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:23,320
It's Sapphire! She's running around out there. Was my magic broken?

83
00:10:24,019 --> 00:10:25,240
That's impossible.

84
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:33,120
That's right, dear. If you have time to dawdle, get ready to leave! Where are we going? Oldland, of course!

85
00:10:33,319 --> 00:10:38,600
Can't you even see which way Fire is running? And you call yourself the Devil King?

86
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:57,760
Huh?

87
00:11:00,619 --> 00:11:03,440
Hey, look! A weird cat came by.

88
00:11:15,139 --> 00:11:17,400
Hey, the cat's dancing!

89
00:11:21,049 --> 00:11:23,580
This cat must have escaped from the circus.

90
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:33,020
Delicious...

91
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,460
Get out!

92
00:11:50,239 --> 00:11:52,800
Sapphire, look! This is the Prince's room.

93
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,800
Wait here, you'll meet him soon.

94
00:12:00,979 --> 00:12:01,979
You may come in.

95
00:12:03,709 --> 00:12:05,060
Who is it? What do you want?

96
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:08,700
Sapphire!

97
00:12:10,335 --> 00:12:11,840
Welcome, Sapphire!

98
00:12:14,389 --> 00:12:16,200
What a wonderful gentleman!

99
00:12:17,329 --> 00:12:18,440
What brings you here today?

100
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,940
What is it? Why are you staying quiet?

101
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:22,220
What's wrong, Sapphire?

102
00:12:22,999 --> 00:12:28,560
Sapphire, you're acting strange. Are you sick? With such a wonderful gentleman on our side, I'm relieved!

103
00:12:29,979 --> 00:12:34,800
Sir! An intruder has broken into the castle! An intruder?

104
00:12:36,939 --> 00:12:40,660
Sapphire is... I see, so that's what happened!

105
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:47,300
There's no one suspicious in here! / Please open up! We need to search your room!

106
00:12:47,449 --> 00:12:49,220
Did someone suspicious break in?

107
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,660
Ah, Lord Chanel!

108
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:54,140
Alright, go! I'll search Franz's room myself!

109
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,320
Yes, sir!

110
00:12:57,409 --> 00:13:00,780
Franz! It's me, Chanel the Fifth! Open up!

111
00:13:01,295 --> 00:13:03,300
Ah! Uncle! I'll open it right now!

112
00:13:20,599 --> 00:13:21,960
Please, come in, Uncle.

113
00:13:23,465 --> 00:13:25,800
If you find anyone suspicious, feel free to throw them out.

114
00:13:32,409 --> 00:13:33,940
Franz, who is this young lady?

115
00:13:35,734 --> 00:13:38,180
A young lady? Take a closer look.

116
00:13:38,625 --> 00:13:40,280
It's a doll my girlfriend gave me.

117
00:13:40,705 --> 00:13:43,760
It's too big for the shelf, so I sat it on the chair.

118
00:13:44,495 --> 00:13:45,560
It's remarkably well made.

119
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,440
Huh!

120
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:55,580
A maiden with honey-colored hair! Ah, so that's it!

121
00:14:06,939 --> 00:14:09,780
Franz! Franz! Franz!

122
00:14:10,629 --> 00:14:13,320
How rude, Franz! Are you planning to marry that doll or something?!

123
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,160
Marriage?

124
00:14:15,569 --> 00:14:19,320
Come on, pull yourself together, Franz. What do you think of this lady?

125
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:26,380
Sure, she's no beauty. But she's incredibly rich!

126
00:14:26,735 --> 00:14:27,735
Not this again...

127
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:33,660
Franz, at least promise to marry this young lady. She comes with a five-billion-yen dowry!

128
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:37,600
With that much money, Goldland will manage to get by.

129
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:38,480
No.

130
00:14:38,635 --> 00:14:39,635
What?!

131
00:14:41,769 --> 00:14:45,780
Marrying for money?! Uncle, I'll choose for myself!

132
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:49,800
Argh! You selfish fool! You might as well just marry this doll!

133
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,800
Dammit! Of course I will! For sure!

134
00:14:53,460 --> 00:14:55,400
Blast it! Is this girl mocking me?!

135
00:14:57,019 --> 00:15:02,800
This time, I'll make him marry this young lady! If he doesn't say yes by Christmas, I'll kick him out of this castle!

136
00:15:07,559 --> 00:15:09,360
As if I'd ever listen to what Uncle says!

137
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,800
Sapphire, I'll never let you go again.

138
00:15:13,535 --> 00:15:15,640
For your sake, I'd gladly give my life.

139
00:15:25,979 --> 00:15:28,080
Sapphire, what really happened to you?

140
00:15:28,190 --> 00:15:29,580
You look just like a real doll.

141
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:36,880
[[NO AUDIO]]

142
00:15:54,709 --> 00:15:57,880
Did you hear that? Now, smash through the roof!

143
00:15:59,329 --> 00:16:03,720
Busting through a roof? Any little imp could do that!

144
00:16:03,915 --> 00:16:05,140
Is there a problem with that?

145
00:16:06,259 --> 00:16:12,900
What a pathetic Devil King. Just because she's a girl, he can't make Hecate a great witch no matter how many years pass. But I'm different.

146
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,520
How do I look?

147
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:31,980
You look beautiful. But what do you plan to do like that?
The scheme is set. Leave it to me.

148
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:41,460
Welcome. Which kingdom's princess are you?
I am the witch of the Kingdom of Pel.

149
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:48,420
And I am her master... er, servant, Stoton.
And what brings you to Goldland?

150
00:16:48,421 --> 00:16:49,840
Well, you see...

151
00:16:51,169 --> 00:16:52,960
Stoton, explain it to him.

152
00:16:53,820 --> 00:17:00,240
At the recent martial arts tournament, my lady took one look at Prince Franz here and fell head over heels.

153
00:17:01,789 --> 00:17:06,599
Oh? First, as a token of our friendship, please accept this gift.

154
00:17:08,739 --> 00:17:11,660
Why, thank you... though the box seems a bit small.

155
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:19,460
In our country, we pave our roads with diamonds, after all.
W-What? Paving roads with diamonds?!

156
00:17:20,899 --> 00:17:25,060
They're just pebbles to us. So you can have as many as you like.

157
00:17:26,229 --> 00:17:33,200
Yes, and if Prince Franz intends to become engaged to Lady Marju, we will gift you ten thousand tons of gold coins.

158
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:36,220
Ten thousand tons...

159
00:17:38,059 --> 00:17:46,480
Ten thousand tons, ten thousand tons, ten thousand tons... Ten thousand tons of gold coins... Lord Channel, so what do you think of this proposal?

160
00:17:46,804 --> 00:17:52,580
Ten thousand tons of gold coins... Lord Channel, how does that sound?

161
00:18:01,929 --> 00:18:07,160
Of course! Is there any better match than this? Franz will be thrilled, I'm sure.

162
00:18:07,844 --> 00:18:21,000
Oh, Strotton... Madam Witch, how wonderful. Now then, may we have a ring as a token of betrothal? Of course, I'll have one made right away. Not THAT ring, but something else...

163
00:18:21,869 --> 00:18:28,661
Anything at all! Prince Franz, a very lovely doll... rice cakes, or a doll...

164
00:18:31,954 --> 00:18:39,840
A doll for a betrothal? Is that strange? No, no, it's wonderful, absolutely wonderful! I'll go fetch it right away. Please wait a moment...

165
00:18:42,849 --> 00:18:45,900
Well, well, looks like things are going smoothly.

166
00:18:46,219 --> 00:18:50,240
Open up! Open it! Franz, open this door!

167
00:18:50,504 --> 00:18:52,000
Hand over the document! Hand it over!

168
00:18:52,254 --> 00:18:54,540
No way! No matter what happens, I'm never giving it to you!

169
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:56,180
Ngh!

170
00:18:58,074 --> 00:18:59,700
With this hand, I can make it work!

171
00:19:00,459 --> 00:19:03,860
Tsuborossho! Akorojissho!

172
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:13,860
What's that?

173
00:19:15,539 --> 00:19:17,300
Hyah! I don't care! Break down the door!

174
00:19:26,269 --> 00:19:28,260
Franz! Franz! Where are you hiding?

175
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,760
There!

176
00:19:32,609 --> 00:19:34,800
Franz is in the courtyard! Search the courtyard!

177
00:19:36,779 --> 00:19:38,380
Sapphire! Hurry! Hurry!

178
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:39,880
I know! Let's hide over there!

179
00:19:47,089 --> 00:19:53,040
This is a chapel. I'm the devil's daughter, so I can't go near it.

180
00:19:59,799 --> 00:20:05,960
Sapphire, I'll never let anyone have you. If anyone comes to capture you, even Chanel V, they'll pay for it.

181
00:20:06,569 --> 00:20:07,569
Did you find Prince Franz?

182
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,200
He's not here!

183
00:20:08,694 --> 00:20:09,700
Alright, search along the way!

184
00:20:12,799 --> 00:20:15,600
Lord Marcho! Lord Marcho! Make sure to use a doll for the professor!

185
00:20:16,319 --> 00:20:20,380
Lord Marcho isn't here. Huh? The jewel... What's going on here?

186
00:20:29,629 --> 00:20:31,440
Things aren't going well at all.

187
00:20:31,834 --> 00:20:36,800
We still have another way. Look at this. It's a potion that turns living things to stone for half a day.

188
00:20:37,589 --> 00:20:40,800
That river flows into the castle and provides their drinking water.

189
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:47,160
Just watch.

190
00:20:55,569 --> 00:20:56,680
The fish turned to stone!

191
00:20:57,529 --> 00:21:00,880
Flow on, river, and turn everything into stone!

192
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:17,580
[(NO AUDIO)]

193
00:21:33,059 --> 00:21:40,940
I have no idea what's going on. The witch is gone, jewels turn to stone... Can we still find Franz?

194
00:21:41,209 --> 00:21:44,800
Hey, what are you dawdling for? What are you doing here?

195
00:21:47,969 --> 00:21:49,820
Stone! They've turned to stone!

196
00:21:51,579 --> 00:21:56,680
It's a demon! A demon's doing! Is anyone there? Somebody!

197
00:21:57,599 --> 00:21:59,740
Hey, someone! Is anyone there?

198
00:22:03,439 --> 00:22:05,780
Someone, please come! Anybody!

199
00:22:06,189 --> 00:22:08,400
No one's here! There's nobody in this castle!

200
00:22:08,620 --> 00:22:10,240
Everyone has turned to stone!

201
00:22:23,909 --> 00:22:25,380
Ah! It's that man!

202
00:22:30,049 --> 00:22:32,960
There must be a demon in this castle!

203
00:22:37,329 --> 00:22:39,820
Sapphire, something seems off. Keep an eye out.

204
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:43,240
Franz! No! Don't go out now!

205
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:44,760
Oh no! He went out!

206
00:22:47,549 --> 00:22:49,320
It's as if there isn't a single living soul here.

207
00:22:49,520 --> 00:22:50,520
Huh!

208
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,160
It's Uncle!

209
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,060
This is strange!

210
00:22:54,264 --> 00:22:55,264
He's not moving at all!

211
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,480
Alright!

212
00:23:00,529 --> 00:23:03,540
Stone! He's turned to stone! It's the devil's work!

213
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:11,760
It's a demon!

214
00:23:11,869 --> 00:23:13,700
Brat! Hand over Sapphire!

215
00:23:14,220 --> 00:23:15,220
What did you say?

216
00:23:15,999 --> 00:23:19,040
Hand Sapphire over and do as you're told, or you'll regret it!

217
00:23:19,214 --> 00:23:21,380
I'll never hand her over, even if you kill me! Here I come!

218
00:23:24,959 --> 00:23:26,260
I am a god!

219
00:23:38,359 --> 00:23:39,820
Is Sapphire in there?

220
00:23:40,149 --> 00:23:42,720
I will never give Sapphire to you!

221
00:23:43,064 --> 00:23:44,680
Ah! It's Refide!

222
00:23:45,220 --> 00:23:46,420
How pathetic!

223
00:23:47,274 --> 00:23:49,820
Zuborasha!

224
00:23:54,669 --> 00:23:56,800
Ah! Water!

225
00:23:58,639 --> 00:23:59,639
Ah! Water!

226
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:00,720
You've come to.

227
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:02,260
Franz!

228
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,280
Sapphire!

229
00:24:17,159 --> 00:24:19,860
Hang in there, Sapphire! Franz!

230
00:24:23,554 --> 00:24:25,800
This will make them burst out along with the water!

231
00:24:27,820 --> 00:24:28,880
Sapphire!

232
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:31,920
Sawaian!

233
00:24:31,940 --> 00:24:32,940
Hold on!

234
00:24:33,474 --> 00:24:35,280
Franz!

235
00:24:35,580 --> 00:24:36,800
Sawaian!

236
00:24:37,940 --> 00:24:38,940
Franz!

237
00:24:39,500 --> 00:24:40,780
Sawaian!

238
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:48,920
Sawaian! Sawaian!

239
00:24:50,609 --> 00:24:54,200
Sapphire! I'll save you... I promise!

240
00:24:54,224 --> 00:24:56,224

